% Binding Tariff Information of EU customs offices (EBTI,
% https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/ebti/) run through the SAME
% model (tariff.le: the whole modelled tariff) as the US rulings.
%
% One scenario per ruling, which the scenario names ("scenario n is, as
% stated in ruling NY ...:"); each article is described by the facts the
% ruling states, each pointing at its passage ("confer "..."");
% the office's judgments — the principal use, the essential character of a
% composite good or set, the answer to a claim that the article belongs to a
% heading outside the model — say who made them. The ruling's code is NOT
% a fact: the expectation is the six-digit subheading the model derives.
% Selection: the most recent valid German BTI for 3923.21, 3923.90, 3924.90
% and 3926.90 (September 2026); the first six digits of the BTI's CN code are
% the HS subheading compared. See README.md for the method and results.

the target language is: prolog.
scenario facts require provenance.

the knowledge base plastics ebti includes these resources:
    tariff.

the knowledge base plastics ebti includes:

% Where each cited ruling is published, and a copy of its text (sources/).
BTI DEBTI19479/26-1 is published at "https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/ebti/ebti_consultation.jsp?Lang=en".
the text of BTI DEBTI19479/26-1 is at "sources/ebti/DEBTI19479_26_1.txt".
BTI DEBTI22676/26-1 is published at "https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/ebti/ebti_consultation.jsp?Lang=en".
the text of BTI DEBTI22676/26-1 is at "sources/ebti/DEBTI22676_26_1.txt".
BTI DEBTI41932/25-1 is published at "https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/ebti/ebti_consultation.jsp?Lang=en".
the text of BTI DEBTI41932/25-1 is at "sources/ebti/DEBTI41932_25_1.txt".
BTI DEBTI47170/25-1 is published at "https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/ebti/ebti_consultation.jsp?Lang=en".
the text of BTI DEBTI47170/25-1 is at "sources/ebti/DEBTI47170_25_1.txt".

query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% The bowl clamp turns on CBP's judgment of its principal use: which judgment
% would have put it in heading 3924, as the importer asked?
query household is:
    which minimal change to the scenario makes it the case that
        the heading of the self-feeding bowl clamp is 3924.

% BTI DEBTI19479/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 09/07/2026: dog waste bags.
scenario bti_debti19479_26_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI19479/26-1:
    the dog waste bags is a manufactured article,
        confer "Antragsangaben sowie dem vorgelegten Warenmuster handelt es sich um Hundekotbeutel aus miteinander verschweißten Folien aus".
    the dog waste bags is made of plastics,
        confer "einem Kunststoff im Sinne der Anmerkung 1 zu Kapitel 39".
    the dog waste bags is shaped as sack,
        confer "Warenmuster handelt es sich um Hundekotbeutel aus miteinander verschweißten Folien aus".
    the dog waste bags contains 100 percent of polyethylene,
        confer "HDPE (High-Density Polyethylen)".
    the dog waste bags is printed with motifs,
        confer "der Schauseite mit diversen Motiven bedruckt und als Rolle auf einer Papphülse aufgemacht".
    the principal use of the dog waste bags is packing of goods,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "Transport- oder Verpackungsmittel aus Kunststoffen".
    the printing of the dog waste bags is merely subsidiary,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "der Schauseite mit diversen Motiven bedruckt und als Rolle auf einer Papphülse aufgemacht".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the dog waste bags is 3923.21"].

% BTI DEBTI22676/26-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 26/06/2026: foam packaging insert.
scenario bti_debti22676_26_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI22676/26-1:
    the foam packaging insert is a manufactured article,
        confer "Antragsangaben sowie der vorgelegten Abbildung handelt es sich um einen quaderförmigen Verpackungseinleger aus aufgeschäumtem Polyethylen".
    the foam packaging insert is made of plastics,
        confer "Verpackungseinleger aus aufgeschäumtem Polyethylen (Kunststoff im Sinne der Anmerkung 1 zu Kapitel 39)".
    the principal use of the foam packaging insert is packing of goods,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "handelt es sich um einen quaderförmigen Verpackungseinleger aus aufgeschäumtem Polyethylen (Kunststoff im Sinne der".
    the foam packaging insert is claimed to belong to sheets of heading 3921,
        confer "Eine Ware der Position 3921 liegt aufgrund der weitergehenden Bearbeitung nicht vor".
    the claim that the foam packaging insert belongs to sheets of heading 3921 is rejected,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "Eine Ware der Position 3921 liegt aufgrund der weitergehenden Bearbeitung nicht vor".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the foam packaging insert is 3923.90"].

% BTI DEBTI41932/25-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 11/11/2025: drinking bottle.
scenario bti_debti41932_25_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI41932/25-1:
    the drinking bottle is a manufactured article,
        confer "sowie der vorliegenden Produktabbildung handelt es sich um eine sogenannte".
    the drinking bottle is a composite good,
        confer "Ø 7,7 x H 26,6 cm) mit einem Fassungsvermögen von etwa 700 ml besteht aus einem zylindrischen".
    the plastic body and lid of the drinking bottle is a component of the drinking bottle,
        confer "Description of goods Nach den Antragsangaben sowie der vorliegenden Produktabbildung handelt es sich".
    the silicone seal of the drinking bottle is a component of the drinking bottle,
        confer "Description of goods Nach den Antragsangaben sowie der vorliegenden Produktabbildung handelt es sich".
    the carrying strap of the drinking bottle is a component of the drinking bottle,
        confer "Description of goods Nach den Antragsangaben sowie der vorliegenden Produktabbildung handelt es sich".
    the plastic body and lid of the drinking bottle is made of plastics,
        confer "Kunststoffen im Sinne der Anmerkung 1 zu Kapitel 39".
    the essential character of the drinking bottle is given by the plastic body and lid of the drinking bottle,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "die Verwendung sind die Kunststoffe charakterverleihend".
    the principal use of the drinking bottle is household use,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "Getränken und wird üblicherweise im Haushalt".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the drinking bottle is 3924.90"].

% BTI DEBTI47170/25-1, Hauptzollamt Hannover, 14/01/2026: system tool crate.
scenario bti_debti47170_25_1 is, as stated in BTI DEBTI47170/25-1:
    the system tool crate is a manufactured article,
        confer "Description of goods Nach den Angaben der Antragstellerin und dem vorgelegten Datenblatt handelt es".
    the system tool crate is made of plastics,
        confer "einem Kunststoff im Sinne der Anmerkung 1 zu Kapitel 39".
    the principal use of the system tool crate is carrying tools,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "Sie dient üblicherweise dem Transport und der Aufbewahrung verschiedenartigster Werkzeuge",
        because "an open crate of a modular tool-case system for transporting and storing tools of all kinds; not an article for the packing of goods (Explanatory Note to heading 3923)".
    the system tool crate is claimed to belong to containers of heading 4202,
        confer "Damit wird sie weder vom Wortlaut der Position 4202 erfasst".
    the claim that the system tool crate belongs to containers of heading 4202 is rejected,
        according to Hauptzollamt Hannover, confer "Damit wird sie weder vom Wortlaut der Position 4202 erfasst".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the system tool crate is 3926.90"].
